{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Ursula is a short and funny adventure game set in a folks tale setting of princes and princesses. Through the game you will play three different characters that each have their part in telling this modern re-imagining of the classic <i>Goldilocks and the Three Bears</i> tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the game, you will control three different characters that each have their role in unfolding the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474790/extras/95c825ac23f73f35105112f8d7d2105c.avif?t=1746537638\" width=680 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you will find in Princess Ursula:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wholesome story oriented adventure game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adaptation of a tale  by professional storyteller Yolaine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A host of fully animated characters to meet and talk to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many humorous hand-drawn animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 1 hour of game time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that can be played, with mouse, keyboard or gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French, English and Brazilian Portuguese translations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some voiced narrations with subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Krale</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474790/extras/41ca9776313f0fc7c0cc31175553a65c.avif?t=1746537638\" width=680 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></